<div class="page-header"><h1>Become a Kitchen Cabinet Dealer in New Mexico</h1><p>Pinnacle Sales is the manufacturer's representative for Shiloh, Eclipse, Aspect, Pronorm German Kitchens, and Vistora Closets across New Mexico — recruiting and supporting kitchen & bath dealers from Albuquerque to the design-driven market of Santa Fe and down to Las Cruces, backed by 23+ years of in-market experience.</p></div>
